    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "gym_koori_020_receptionist_01",
      "hash64": "370501FDAA453FEC",
      "text": "歡迎光臨霜抹山道館！\\n要再聽一次道館測驗的說明嗎？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "gym_koori_020_receptionist_02",
      "hash64": "370504FDAA454505",
      "text": "霜抹山道館的道館測驗是\\n[VAR 0xFF00(0006)]滑雪山[VAR 0xFF00(0000)]！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 12,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "gym_koori_020_receptionist_03",
      "hash64": "370503FDAA454352",
      "text": "請騎著坐騎寶可夢滑下指定的賽道，\\n在限制時間內抵達終點！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "gym_koori_020_receptionist_04",
      "hash64": "3704FEFDAA453AD3",
      "text": "詳細規則會在滑雪山的起點為[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳說明。\\n走出道館後爬上左手邊的坡道，\\r\\n就能到起點了。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 13,
          "count": 3,
