    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "gym_koori_020_trainer_01",
      "hash64": "64B056279C27961C",
      "text": "嗨，我正等著[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳呢。\\n這裡就是滑雪山的起點。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 6,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "gym_koori_020_trainer_02",
      "hash64": "64B059279C279B35",
      "text": "我要請[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳騎著坐騎寶可夢\\n滑下大自然的賽道。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 3,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "gym_koori_020_trainer_03",
      "hash64": "64B058279C279982",
      "text": "只要能在目標時間內抵達終點，\\n就算通過道館測驗了！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "gym_koori_020_trainer_04",
      "hash64": "64B053279C279103",
      "text": "要現在就挑戰道館測驗\\n滑雪山嗎？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "gym_koori_020_trainer_05",
      "hash64": "64B052279C278F50",
      "text": "請好好享受白銀世界吧。\\n那麼，測驗開始！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "gym_koori_020_select_01",
      "hash64": "66DD846D70418449",
      "text": "挑戰",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "gym_koori_020_select_02",
      "hash64": "66DD816D70417F30",
      "text": "聽說明",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "gym_koori_020_select_03",
      "hash64": "66DD826D704180E3",
      "text": "還是算了",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "gym_koori_020_trainer_06",
      "hash64": "64B055279C279469",
      "text": "恭喜[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳抵達終點！\\n[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳滑得棒極了！\\r\\n簡直像是職業選手時期的古魯夏……",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 2,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 15,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 28,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "gym_koori_020_system_01",
      "hash64": "5BAE1046691347DE",
      "text": "啊，對了！[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳的道館測驗非常成功！\\n請去向櫃台報告結果喔！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 5,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "gym_koori_020_trainer_07",
      "hash64": "64B054279C2792B6",
      "text": "很遺憾，[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳的滑雪山失敗了！\\n但幸好[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳沒受傷！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 4,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "gym_koori_020_trainer_08",
      "hash64": "64B05F279C27A567",
      "text": "放心！道館測驗可以重複挑戰，\\n沒有次數的限制！\\r\\n別氣餒，別勉強，好好加油就是了！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
